# Deploy

A squash merge to `main` is the only publish. `.github/workflows/deploy.yml` runs on that push.

- GitHub Pages publishes the Vite build.
- Firestore rules and indexes publish with `firebase deploy --only firestore`.

Do not deploy from a laptop. Do not run `firebase deploy`, and do not upload `dist/` by hand. A change to rules, indexes, or the page waits for the pull request to merge.
